               "text": "#### Exercising Multiplication\n\nTo reinforce multiplication, we are going to do an exercise relating numbers to body movements. Follow the exercise and see how numbers are connected to us.\n\nThe selector above allows you to choose which multiplication table to practice, and the speed slider adjusts the pace of the movements. Try to do the movements with your own body if you can — it is a great way to take care of your health as well.",
